                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "My wife and I spent a couple evenings playing the game together.  The puzzles are varied and interesting.  Many of them are mathematically based and a little more challenging then your typical puzzle fare.  The game runs well on a low powered laptop, transitions are smooth, and we experienced no stalls, hangs, or crashes.\n\nAll in all we thoroughly enjoyed the game and would definitely purchase another from this developer.  Even though there were no reviews of the game, we took a chance on it and were happy we did.",
